{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國實力派男歌手CRUSH將於後日公開與天后IU合作的新單曲《SEESAW》，是他去年8月發布《FANG》以來，相隔一年零兩個月再有新作面世。兩人過往曾為對方的演唱會擔任嘉賓，今次則是首度合作歌曲。而在率先曝光的宣傳照中，IU與CRUSH分別身穿婚紗及禮服，CRUSH彈琴為IU伴奏，樂迷對新曲大感期待！</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T02:19:28.805251+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T02:05:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T04:17:41.477246+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T02:17:45.007798+00:00","content_hash":"badd0d89f2834226e5dc7fb6c0ad4435250b428aab0f891c5f800924ff7c2c1e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}